  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "e946f996-c1cc-4a73-acc5-ca13f8f196df",
      "question": "Among the 1,000 most liquid US stocks, which five beat the group's average return by the most, and which five trailed it by the most, from January 2, 2025 through March 12, 2026?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-06T23:57:19.337399Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-06T23:57:48.166211Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Window:** January 2, 2025 – March 12, 2026 (297–298 trading sessions)\n**Universe:** 1,000 most liquid US stocks (liquid_1000)\n**Metric:** Peer-relative return = asset return − universe mean return (fractions converted to percentages)\n\n---\n\n### Five that beat the group average by the most\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Peer-relative return | Total return | Daily volatility | Evidence |\n|------|--------|----------------------|--------------|------------------|----------|\n| 1 | DFDV | +3,629.16% | +3,653.45% | 71.09% | [1] |\n| 2 | AXTI | +2,009.50% | +2,033.79% | 7.50% | [1] |\n| 3 | ABVX | +1,480.38% | +1,504.66% | 34.18% | [1] |\n| 4 | CELC | +719.35% | +743.64% | 10.53% | [1] |\n| 5 | ASM | +648.92% | +673.21% | 5.27% | [1] |\n\n---\n\n### Five that trailed the group average by the most\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Peer-relative return | Total return | Daily volatility | Evidence |\n|------|--------|----------------------|--------------|------------------|----------|\n| 1 | DOGZ | −120.79% | −96.50% | 9.87% | [2] |\n| 2 | CHOW | −120.36% | −96.07% | 14.05% | [2] |\n| 3 | DFNS | −120.06% | −95.77% | 9.16% | [2] |\n| 4 | BZAI | −116.89% | −92.60% | 8.86% | [2] |\n| 5 | CANG | −112.92% | −88.63% | 5.56% | [2] |\n\n**Limitations:** CHOW only traded in ~41% of the sessions (coverage ratio 0.41), so its figures are based on a partial history. All results are descriptive historical observations, not investment advice.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:d906b9e69e2cf4f29d31d093b9209e3fbee575868f22682f072223cac8b09be8`\n- [2] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:00d1e98e7f39c573b0b74bcfe4310273017b8bbc23492df483efa06d10179101`",
